<article class="privacy-page">
  <div class="privacy-shell">
    <p class="privacy-kicker">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy, in plain language.</h1>
    <p class="privacy-lead">This site is a portfolio, not a mailing list. I only use the information you send to reply to your message or discuss a possible collaboration.</p>

    <div class="privacy-content">
      <section><h2>Who is responsible?</h2><p>Tereza Britta Švanda is responsible for this website and the contact form. You can reach me at <a href="mailto:brittasvanda@gmail.com">brittasvanda@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
      <section><h2>What I collect</h2><p>If you use the contact form, I receive the name, email address, topic and message you choose to provide. The website may also process limited technical information necessary to deliver the site securely, such as server logs.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Why and on what basis</h2><p>I process contact-form messages to answer your enquiry and, where relevant, take steps towards a possible collaboration. The basis is my legitimate interest in responding to direct professional enquiries and, where applicable, steps requested before entering a contract.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Who handles the form</h2><p>The contact form is processed by <a href="https://formspree.io/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formspree</a>, which delivers the submission to my email inbox. Formspree acts as a processor and states that it uses Standard Contractual Clauses for relevant international transfers. Messages are then received through Gmail.</p></section>
      <section><h2>How long I keep it</h2><p>I keep contact correspondence only as long as needed to handle the enquiry and any resulting collaboration, and normally no longer than 12 months when no collaboration follows. You may ask me to delete it sooner.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask to access, correct or delete your personal data, restrict its use, or object to processing based on legitimate interests. Email me at the address above. If you are in the EU, you may also complain to your local data-protection authority.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Cookies and external services</h2><p>This portfolio does not run advertising or analytics cookies of its own. It uses GitHub Pages for hosting and Google Fonts to display typography; those providers may process basic technical data required to serve their services.</p></section>
      <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: 11 October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
